Keith,

Two volumes of the Rdb doc set would take care of this for you -- "The VAX
Rdb Guide to Using SQL" is a very complete tutorial in the use of both
interactive SQL and the 3GL interfaces; "The DEC Rdb SQL Reference Manual"
provides a complete reference with lots of examples.  I believe you can
order them by dialing 1-800-DIGITAL.  The guide was updated for V5.0, the
reference manual for V5.1 -- and both will be replaced soon for V6.0 (you'll
get the most recent versions when you order).

Have fun this semester,

